{"id": "samsung_elec-2026-09-29-003", "date": "2026-09-29", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 9, "week": 40, "weekday": "Tue"}, "entities": {"companies": ["samsung_elec"], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": [], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Samsung To Invest USD 1 Billion in AI Infrastructure Company Helix", "content": "Samsung Electronics, Samsung C&T, Samsung SDS, Samsung SDI, Samsung Life Insurance and Samsung Fire & Marine Insurance today announced they are investing a combined USD 1 billion in Helix Digital Infrastructure, an AI infrastructure company established by global investment firm KKR. Launched in June 2026, Helix is an AI-enabling infrastructure provider that is designed to […]", "sources": [{"name": "samsung_elec", "url": "https://news.samsung.com/global/samsung-to-invest-usd-1-billion-in-ai-infrastructure-company-helix", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-09-29-004", "date": "2026-09-29", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 9, "week": 40, "weekday": "Tue"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["oled_penetration"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Honor launches its Watch 6 Pro smartwatch, the world's first product to sport an OLED display produced using a lithography process", "content": "<p>Honor just announced its latest smartwatch, the <a href=\"https://www.oled-info.com/honor-watch-6-pro\">Watch 6 Pro</a> which sports a 1.5\" 466 x 466 5,500 nits (peak brightness) tandem AMOLED. The high-end display is produced by <a href=\"https://www.oled-info.com/spotlight-visionox-deep-dive-companys-history-vip-technology-spin-outs-fabs-and\">Visionox</a> using its ViP maskless process - this is perhaps the first commercial display that is produced with a maskless OLED process.</p><p><img src=", "sources": [{"name": "oled_info", "url": "https://www.oled-info.com/new-honor-watch-6-pro-smartwatch-sports-tandem-vip-amoled-visionox", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "samsung_elec-2026-09-29-005", "date": "2026-09-29", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 9, "week": 40, "weekday": "Tue"}, "entities": {"companies": ["samsung_elec"], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": [], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Samsung reshuffles DRAM roadmap, prioritizing B1b hybrid bonding for D0a, HBM5", "content": "Samsung Electronics is reshaping its next-generation dynamic random-access memory (DRAM) roadmap, elevating its B1b wafer-to-wafer (W2W) hybrid bonding technology from a project-specific development to the core technology behind D0a, its first sub-10nm DRAM generation. Industry observers believe Samsung's push to commercialize B1b DRAM earlier could also benefit its next-generation high-bandwidth memory (HBM) products, including HBM5.", "sources": [{"name": "digitimes_display", "url": "https://www.digitimes.com/news/a20260929PD238/samsung-dram-roadmap-technology-development.html", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "samsung_elec-2026-09-29-006", "date": "2026-09-29", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 9, "week": 40, "weekday": "Tue"}, "entities": {"companies": ["samsung_elec"], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": [], "sentiment": {"label": "positive", "score": 0.5, "keywords": ["expand"]}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Samsung Electro-Mechanics to invest US$5 billion in ABF substrate expansion", "content": "Samsung Electro-Mechanics said it will invest KRW6.78 trillion (about US$5 billion) in South Korea and Vietnam to expand ABF substrate production for AI servers and high-performance computing (HPC) markets. Part of the funding reportedly comes from advance payments by Nvidia and other global technology companies. With Samsung Electro-Mechanics having already entered Nvidia's NVSwitch and Groq 3 supply chains, the two companies' cooperation is expected to extend from an existing supply relationsh", "sources": [{"name": "digitimes_display", "url": "https://www.digitimes.com/news/a20260929PD231/semco-abf-substrate-nvidia-capacity-production.html", "type": "rss"}]}
