{"id": "lg_display-2026-09-29-016", "date": "2026-09-29", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 9, "week": 40, "weekday": "Tue"}, "entities": {"companies": ["lg_display", "lg_elec", "samsung_elec", "jdi"], "customers": ["lg_elec", "samsung_elec"], "suppliers": ["lg_display"]}, "topics": ["oled_penetration"], "sentiment": {"label": "negative", "score": -0.5, "keywords": ["[否定]mass production"]}, "importance": {"score": 0.9, "reasons": ["多公司提及", "供應鏈上下游同時提及"]}, "title": "The Korean government may provide financial support for LGD's FLiPP maskless OLED production project", "content": "<p>In August 2026, LG Display <a href=\"https://www.oled-info.com/heres-lg-displays-flipp-maskless-oled-production-process-logo\">officially announced</a> that it has developed a new <a href=\"https://www.oled-info.com/inside-maskless-oled-revolution-applied-materials-visionox-jdi-samsung-and-race\">maskless OLED production process</a>, branded as FLiPP, or FMM-Less innovative Pixel Patterning. LG says that its FLiPP OLEDs will offer greater flexibility in mass production as well as high brightness,", "sources": [{"name": "oled_info", "url": "https://www.oled-info.com/korean-government-may-provide-financial-support-lgds-flipp-maskless-oled", "type": "rss"}]}
